<app-nav title="确认订单" /><view class="screen with-dock"><page-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry" /><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}" class="stack enter">
<button class="address-card card" bindtap="chooseAddress" hover-class="press"><view class="row"><view class="address-icon"><ui-icon name="pin" size="44" /></view><view class="grow" wx:if="{{address}}"><view class="row"><text class="subheading">{{address.name}}</text><text class="caption">{{address.phone}}</text></view><text class="address-text">{{address.province}}{{address.city}}{{address.district}}{{address.detail}}</text></view><view class="grow" wx:else><text class="subheading">这份美味，送到哪里？</text><text class="caption address-text">添加或选择收货地址</text></view><ui-icon name="right" size="34" /></view></button>
<view class="card"><view class="row between"><text class="subheading">商品清单</text><text class="caption">共 {{itemCount}} 件</text></view><view class="list-item row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="productId"><view class="thumb"><image src="{{item.image || '/assets/icons/leaf-green.png'}}" mode="aspectFit" lazy-load /></view><view class="grow"><text class="item-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="caption">{{item.spec}}</text><view class="row between"><text class="price order-item-price"><text class="currency">¥</text>{{item.priceText}}</text><text class="caption">× {{item.quantity}}</text></view></view></view></view>
<view class="card delivery-card"><view class="row"><ui-icon name="truck" size="42" /><view class="grow"><text class="subheading">配送与售后</text><text class="caption delivery-copy">配送范围、时效及运费以店铺确认结果为准；生鲜商品收到后请及时检查，如有异常请联系客服。</text></view></view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="subheading">支付方式</view><button wx:for="{{payTypes}}" wx:key="value" class="pay-row" data-type="{{item.value}}" bindtap="pay"><ui-icon name="{{item.icon}}" size="40" /><view class="grow"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="caption">{{item.note}}</text></view><text class="pay-check">{{payType === item.value ? '●' : '○'}}</text></button><text class="caption">线下付款将在店铺确认到账后安排发货，商品金额以店铺最终核验为准。</text></view>
<view class="card"><view class="field-label">给店铺留言</view><textarea class="input textarea" placeholder="例如收货时间偏好（选填）" maxlength="200" value="{{remark}}" bindinput="remark" auto-height /><view class="row between section"><text>商品金额</text><text>¥{{totalText}}</text></view><view class="row between"><text class="caption">配送费用</text><text class="caption">店铺确认</text></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="row between"><text class="subheading">商品合计</text><text class="price"><text class="currency">¥</text>{{totalText}}</text></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{uncertain}}" class="notice">订单结果尚未确认，请先前往订单列表核对，避免重复下单。<button class="text-button" bindtap="viewOrders">查看我的订单</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{submitted}}" class="notice">订单已提交。<button class="text-button" bindtap="viewOrders">查看我的订单</button></view>
</view></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}" class="dock"><view class="dock-summary"><text class="caption">应付金额</text><view class="price"><text class="currency">¥</text>{{totalText}}</view></view><button class="primary" disabled="{{busy || submitted || uncertain}}" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit" hover-class="press">{{submitted ? '订单已提交' : '提交订单'}}</button></view>
<app-modal show="{{review}}" title="确认提交订单" confirm-text="确认下单" busy="{{busy}}" bindcancel="cancel" bindconfirm="confirm">将使用{{payTypeLabel}}结算 ¥{{totalText}}，最终价格与库存由店铺核验。</app-modal>
